{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami02_title", "source_sha256": "80cc537ef0a12da00b923fa21eb594bf01e91b240de81a9738aebbc11a4ecd35", "ja": "亜美とおでかけ2", "zh": "和亚美出门2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "edf36fa178e78623b3748ed6ca1ea0a519a1b858dfb9306514bd80e626ac1e3c", "ja": "亜美とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和亚美外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "38375046c071af9ff97f7cca2f4569c993a71285697223291dacf9f51bb88c3b", "ja": "（オフの亜美と大阪を散策している。面白いものが\nたくさんあるな……それに、雰囲気も東京とは違う）", "zh": "（和休假的亚美一起在大阪逛街。这里有好多有意思的东西啊……而且，氛围也和东京不一样。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami02_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "5818967bd0cc962bf07f708978dcc494420d8716397f7f4311fdacdf6a6a3bc1", "ja": "兄ちゃん！　亜美さっきのお店にあった『食い倒れ\n2号の頭がびよーんってなるキーホルダー』ほしい！", "zh": "哥哥！亜美想要刚才那家店里的“食倒2号头会嗖地伸长的钥匙扣”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8a6a4f85eddfe90f2a61c45c20dc61983dbe64c907105689236bc6cdec6e5958", "ja": "食い倒れ2号のグッズはたくさん買っただろ！\nもう十分だ！", "zh": "你已经买了很多吃到撑2号的周边了吧！已经够多了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami02_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "35f4655270857fde169912f750b97be948cbf8144db33637f66aa7ac968855a5", "ja": "十分じゃないもん！　買ったのは音が鳴るやつと\n伸びるやつと、えーっと、とにかく全然ちがうっしょ！", "zh": "才不够呢！买的是会发出声音的、会伸长的，还有……总之，完全不一样吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e44388f2742e2cc99a9f0e4e25b46bcf152024d9bef6afc33295c0b7679c0a7e", "ja": "そんなに食い倒れ2号ばっかりあってどうするんだ……\nとにかく、必要ない！", "zh": "有那么多吃垮大阪2号干什么……  \n总之，根本不需要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami02_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "04eeda15e6f56e457d0104ae32f5a5cb7f6717c7f19c770b228ecf988dd633fb", "ja": "兄ちゃんのケチ！　わからずや2号！　ふーんっだ！", "zh": "哥哥真小气！第2号死脑筋！哼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "308018ab521611ef916374953d359156d16c16c557bed5db66141e8fa81dedeb", "ja": "いいから行くぞ。……ん？　ふぐグッズの専門店が\nあるな。あのミニちょうちん、なかなか可愛いな。", "zh": "行了，走吧。……嗯？这里有一家河豚周边专卖店。那个迷你灯笼，还挺可爱的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami02_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "69e9abe5b89d22edfee9952be0bd96bd96581036dbb08ea772492302ad8e4c05", "ja": "ふぐ！　ねえ、あのオスとメスのフグがちゅっちゅ\nしてるのが欲しい！　『ふぐ愛』だって！", "zh": "河豚！呐，我想要那个公河豚和母河豚啾啾亲亲的！上面还写着“河豚爱”呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a72ee89a931e1ffc2cf3f8a16c7a449eabefc111d03f86b1e9a7d569ffd9eacb", "ja": "ひょっとして『不具合』とかけているのか？\n大阪の人のセンスは独特だな……。", "zh": "难道是在玩“不具合”的谐音吗？大阪人的品味还真独特啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami02_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "72966bdbdbb1428b59570f48d01e241bbf3c18d270347fe83ba9755ff2004932", "ja": "ねー、兄ちゃん兄ちゃん、買ってよー！", "zh": "呐——哥哥哥哥，买给我嘛——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "336ed73c5820a0dd38685a79e27f00b01eb1cbe7f5cdb9d6c8d53da2b45cf567", "ja": "わかったわかった……これで最後だからな！", "zh": "好啦好啦……这可是最后一次了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_011ami02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_011ami02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "676e76d245d661618d39d2f7e2e4c73e49a8e6952595b1b2e470314344f18934", "ja": "（謎のグッズをたくさん買わされてしまったが、亜美は\nとてもうれしそうにしている。ま、結果オーライだな）", "zh": "（虽然被亜美弄得买了好多莫名其妙的周边，不过她看起来特别开心。嘛，结果好就行了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
